is by a stretch factor of $5.$\n\nTherefore, the given curve is the graph of $y=5sin⁡(-x).$\n\nNotice that, because the sine function is odd, the $y$-axis reflection has the same effect as the $x$-axis reflection, i.e.,\n\n$$\n5sin⁡(-x)=-5sin⁡x.\n$$\n\nSo the graph could also be viewed as $y=-5sin⁡x.$ However, $y=-5sin⁡x$ is not among the given options." 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246321 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246322 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246323 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246324 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246325 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1041 "selection" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246325 13194139533680 true] [17592186246320 1110 #uuid "ee1da551-a4a2-5d93-8dfd-2dc28e4f396d" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246321 1034 "y=\\frac{1}{5}sin⁡(-x)" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246321 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533680 true] [17592186246321 1111 #uuid "2069b33d-7220-5304-adf1-d2753698a484" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246322 1034 "y=sin⁡(-x)-5" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246322 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533680 true] [17592186246322 1111 #uuid "81832f71-5f1f-5ebe-b6a8-facf1a8d0c6e" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246323 1034 "y=sin⁡(-\\frac{x}{5})" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246323 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533680 true] [17592186246323 1111 #uuid "1981d624-c085-5942-9c4b-76868a0a9284" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246324 1034 "y=sin⁡(-5x)" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246324 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533680 true] [17592186246324 1111 #uuid "c8458d00-aab9-57a1-bfb0-671475a88144" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246325 1034 "y=5sin⁡(-x)" 13194139533680 true] [17592186246325 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533680 true] [17592186246325 1111 #uuid "4cd46fa8-93